# Approved scope

- Name the approved Issue number and plan revision before editing.
- Read the `[Plan]` comment and the `[Approval record]`.
- Edit only the plan's allowed paths. An empty allow-list allows nothing.
- Run `npm run check` before opening the pull request.
- Stop at the pull request. Do not merge.
